Z||000010||86se/lambo||07-12-2000||10:49 PM||||there is a reason its metal..pontiac would have used rubber/neoprene if they could have. i wouldnt mess with fuel lines..do it right and then dont worry about it again. just my $.02.<BR>no biggie..but i agree with cliff/batboy||||reg||1
Z||000011||shain||07-13-2000||03:34 AM||||no no no there will be no welding!!! it is a small peice of rubber hose that i am putting over the metal gas line. any ways i already did it and it doesnt seem to be leaking.. but you are right i guess it is better to do it right the first time, but my car sucks so its cool!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
